{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即以前所制而重犯者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因第七戒中無有過量罪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏中指此為三品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有場大界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無場大界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共集至大界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他處或作蘭若、亦此意也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前曾受五八十具而破前四重者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以無可捨故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但至誠懇切、懺之不必得清淨相也。"}
